Common Pending Causes at a Glance
Cause	Command to Check	Typical Fix
Insufficient CPU/Memory	kubectl describe pod, kubectl top nodes	Add resources or reduce requests
Node NotReady	kubectl get nodes	Restore node health
Taints	kubectl describe node	Add toleration or use another node
Node Selector/Affinity	kubectl get nodes --show-labels	Match labels and selectors
PVC Pending	kubectl get pvc	Bind the PVC or configure storage
Scheduler issue	kubectl get pods -n kube-system	Ensure the scheduler is running

Check cluster events

kubectl get events
Verify resources, networking, storage, and scheduling before concluding.
